### Endpoint Hola mundo

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Probar suma
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/suma?num1=100&num2=15

### Probar suma 2
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/suma
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "num1": 50,
    "num2": 30
}

### Probar dividir
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/dividir
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "num1": 300,
    "num2": 10
}

### consultar contacto
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/contactos

### registrar contactos
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/contacto
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Ana",
    "email": "ana@test.com",
    "telefono": "12345"
}